  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Dungeon Crawl 會生成大型的地下迷宮式地牢結構。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"> 地牢的佈局、戰利品與大小皆為隨機生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">支援的模組載入器：<strong>Forge</strong>（最高至 1.20.1）、<strong>NeoForge</strong>（1.20.4 及更高版本）<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">正在尋找&nbsp;<strong>Fabric </strong>版本嗎？請前往 Modrinth 查看&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252froguelikedungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roguelike Dungeons 的官方續作</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"> -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>已知問題：<br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Minecraft 1.16 中存在一項<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-189565\" rel=\"nofollow\">錯誤</a>，當渲染特定生物的刷怪籠時，可能會造成嚴重的幀率下降，</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">包含終界使者。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spawner-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spawner Bug Fix</a> 模組可修復此問題。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本模組目前仍在積極開發中，尚未完成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們會定期釋出包含優化、新內容與錯誤修正的更新。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">（下一步將對地牢生成機制進行全面重寫）&nbsp; <br></span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Qb7P3zZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#339\">加入 Discord 社群！</span></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><em>Dungeon Crawl 為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roguelike-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roguelike Dungeons</a> 的精神續作。</em></span><em><br></em></p>",
